<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the Board shall be officially and judicially noticed. Power to establish companies"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
