<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall hold such number of meetings as may be necessary for the due fulfillment of its functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
