<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Before the beginning of September of each year, the Board shall submit to the Minister an estimate of the expenditure including the expenditure for development projects, for the following year in such form and containing such particulars as the Minister may direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
