<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "“Gallery” includes a branch of the National Visual Arts Gallery established under section 30; “national visual arts collection” and “national collection” means all works of visual arts acquired by the Board; “Fund” means the National Visual Arts Fund established under section 22; “Board” means the National Visual Arts Development Board established under section 3; “acquire” means acquire by way of purchase, transfer, grant, exchange, gift, settlement or otherwise; “officer of the Board” includes the Director General; “visual arts operator” means any person who carries on any visual arts business or operation; “visual art” means art created from a suitable medium, technique, process or technology, appeals to the visual sense and exists in tangible form; “appointed date” means the date on which this Act comes into operation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
