<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The National Art Gallery Act 1959 [Act 516] is repealed and the Board of Trustees of the National Art Gallery (the “dissolved Board”) is dissolved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
