<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the provisions of this Act, all powers, rights, privileges, duties, liabilities or obligations which immediately before the appointed date were those of the dissolved Board shall, as from that date, devolve on the Board established by this Act. Transfer of property"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
