<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the provisions of this Act, any land which immediately before the appointed date was vested in the Government of Malaysia in respect of the dissolved Board shall, on that date, by virtue of this Act be vested in the Government of Malaysia in respect of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
