<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44> <https://schema.org/text> "All moneys standing in, belonging or due to be paid to the National Art Gallery Fund shall, on the appointed date, be vested in the Board established by this Act, be transferred to and be deemed to be part of the Fund established under section 22. Continuance of officers and servants"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
