<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Board or against any member of the Board, any member of a committee, any officer, servant or agent of the Board in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by it or him in such capacity. Public servants"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
