<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person invited under subparagraph (1) may be paid such fee as the Board may determine. Disclosure of interest"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/eng@> .
